<p>The venue opened with the movie “The Pawn of Fate” featuring George Beban who played Pierre, a French peasant aspiring to be a great painter and travels to Paris. The corresponding article in the Mandan Pioneer bragged "Mr. Beban’s acting will succeed in sweeping the onlooker from laughter to tears and then from tears to laughter.</p>

