<p>Palace Theater 1937 The venue would also host live local performances such as the annual Christmas program presented by the Mandan Music Club. In 1935 and while under the ownership of Frank Wetzstein, a major remodeling effort was undertaken with the installation of an air condition system. The machinery, costing $6000 ($105,000 2015$) kept the interior at a constant at 70 degrees even during the hottest summer day, replacing the rooms' entire air supply every minute.</p>

